# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What must NOT be committed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This project is published to GitHub Pages as a plain static site: the app is
# index.html + login.html plus the study-text PDFs that sit next to them. The
# PDFs ARE part of the site and MUST be committed - they are deliberately not
# listed here.
#
# prc-app/ is a separate Next.js development app. Its dependency and build
# folders are ~1 GB (node_modules ~657 MB, .next ~362 MB). Committing them
# bloats the repository past GitHub's practical limits and is a very common
# reason a push or a Pages deployment silently drops the large PDFs while the
# small HTML files still go through - which shows up as "the app loads but the
# books are 404".
prc-app/node_modules/
prc-app/.next/
prc-app/out/

# local Pages build output (see _build/tools/build_site.py)
_site/

# Python bytecode caches
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
